"                    tắt gì."
msgstr ""
"A snooze <b>always has a deadline</b>. At the deadline the system\n"
"                    reopens it and writes a note on the alarm — silencing something\n"
"                    for good is how a plant loses a whole layer of watchfulness\n"
"                    with nobody remembering what was turned off."

